\item[S2] T. Ohtsuki (editor), \emph{Problems on invariants of knots and 3-manifolds}, Geometry \& Topology Monographs 4 (2002), pp. 377--572 (published 2004), item 1.2 and its surrounding definitions and remarks. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0406190v1}.
